-- the memory's two laws, proven (part of machine-in-hyperactive): a wire just written reads as what
-- was written, and writing one wire leaves the reading of every other wire as it was. Every later
-- proof about steps (that steps at different wires commute) rests on these two.
nk-eqw-refl : (a : Word) → eqw a a ≡ true
nk-eqw-refl a = %welimP (λ v → eqw v v ≡ true) a refl (λ n h → h)
